B.Wf=s(["Thanks for helping test Sokie. Here is how working through Sokie works during the beta. These are in addition to the Terms of Use and Privacy Policy."],t.s)
B.V8=new A.cV("For Runners",B.Wf)
B.YW=s(["You run your own independent business. You are not an employee of Sokie. You choose which jobs to accept, when to work, and how to do the work, and you can work elsewhere. You are responsible for your own taxes, equipment, and expenses."],t.s)
B.Ve=new A.cV("1. You are an independent contractor",B.YW)
B.XC=s(["You must be 18+, legally allowed to do the work, and complete onboarding, which may include identity verification (via Stripe Identity) and, where it applies, background or credential checks. Keep your information accurate."],t.s)
B.UY=new A.cV("2. Getting started",B.XC)
B.Ye=s(["You are responsible for holding any licenses, permits, and insurance the law requires for the work you offer \u2014 especially for skilled trades. Do not accept jobs you are not qualified or permitted to do. Please provide proof when asked."],t.s)
B.UZ=new A.cV("3. Licenses & insurance",B.Ye)
B.WX=s(["For each completed job you receive the agreed service amount, minus Sokie\u2019s service commission. A separate platform fee is charged to the customer. Payouts are made through Stripe Connect \u2014 you will set up a Stripe account and agree to Stripe\u2019s Connected Account terms. The customer\u2019s payment is held and released on completion; payout timing follows Stripe\u2019s schedule. Tips go to you."],t.s)
B.Vd=new A.cV("4. How you get paid",B.WX)
B.YN=s(["You are responsible for reporting and paying your own taxes on what you earn. Sokie and/or Stripe may provide tax forms where required and may need to report certain information."],t.s)
B.V2=new A.cV("5. Taxes",B.YN)
B.VD=s(["Do the job professionally, safely, and lawfully; bring your own tools and transport unless agreed otherwise; communicate through the app; and get the customer\u2019s approval before doing extra work or changing the price."],t.s)
B.V_=new A.cV("6. Doing the work",B.VD)
B.X9=s(["For jobs you get through Sokie, do not arrange payment off-platform to avoid fees or divert Sokie customers away from the app."],t.s)
B.Vb=new A.cV("7. Keep it on Sokie",B.X9)
B.YH=s(["Use customer information only to do the job, keep it private, and do not reuse it for your own purposes."],t.s)
B.Vk=new A.cV("8. Customer information",B.YH)
B.WA=s(["Your profile may show ratings and verification status. We may suspend or deactivate accounts for safety concerns, policy or legal violations, or loss of required credentials."],t.s)
B.UT=new A.cV("9. Ratings & account",B.WA)
B.Xa=s(['Sokie is provided "as is" during beta. To the extent the law allows, Sokie is not liable for indirect losses, and our responsibility to you is limited to the commissions we earned from your recent jobs. You can stop anytime, and we may end the beta or your access as described here.'],t.s)
B.V9=new A.cV("10. Beta disclaimer, liability & ending",B.Xa)
B.WR=s(["Questions about Runner payments or your account: support@sokie.com. (Sokie)"],t.s)
